  "description": "A portable cutter a colonist operates from the interaction cell. On a spice blow it scrapes melange quickly (about twice hand-harvesting) and throws strong machine vibration into the sand. On ordinary exposed Arrakis sand with no deposit, the same machine slowly sifts trace spice from the erg — useful in drought, never a substitute for a blow. It does nothing while idle, flicked off, or packed. Requires spice prospecting.",
